silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_15_cocone_apex_and_naturality_sections_01_cocone_apex_construction_step_by_step_concrete_anchor_3_DomesticCat#domesticcat silm:hasLongDescription "The DomesticCat is the domestic-cat refinement class; a:Mittens->DomesticCat under r:DomesticCat->Cat. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'DomesticCat', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
